    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "そぼうで　みがってな　せいかく。 きぶんが　のらなければ　トレーナーの めいれいも　へいきで　むしするぞ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Un Pokémon brutal qui n’en fait qu’à sa tête. Selon son humeur du moment, il lui arrive d’ignorer sciemment les ordres de son Dresseur.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "This Pokémon has a violent, selfish disposition. If it’s not in the mood to listen, it will ignore its Trainer’s orders with complete nonchalance.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "粗暴で　身勝手な　性格。 気分が　乗らなければ　トレーナーの 命令も　平気で　無視するぞ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "きょうれつな　パンチや　キックを おみまいしたあと　へその　あたりから ほのおを　ふきだし　とどめを　さす。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Après avoir asséné une pluie de coups de pied et de poing à son adversaire, il l’asperge de flammes ardentes sortant de son nombril.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "After hurling ferocious punches and flinging furious kicks, it finishes opponents off by spewing fire from around its navel.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "強烈な　パンチや　キックを お見舞いしたあと　へその　あたりから 炎を　吹き出し　止めを　刺す。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "あらっぽく　わがままだが　かくしたを なぶることは　つまらないので　キライ。 かくうえの　あいてに　やるきを　だす。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Un Pokémon brutal qui n’en fait qu’à sa tête. Selon son humeur du moment, il lui arrive parfois d’ignorer sciemment les ordres de son Dresseur.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Although it’s rough mannered and egotistical, it finds beating down unworthy opponents boring. It gets motivated for stronger opponents.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "荒っぽく　わがままだが　格下を なぶることは　つまらないので　キライ。 格上の　相手に　やる気を　出す。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "とうそうしんに　ひが　つくと こしの　まわりに　ある　ほのおも ひときわ　はげしく　もえあがる。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Les flammes autour de ses hanches brûlent d’une ardeur redoublée quand sa combativité s’embrase.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "When its fighting spirit is set alight, the flames around its waist become especially intense.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "闘争心に　火が　つくと 腰の　まわりに　ある　炎も ひと際　激しく　燃えあがる。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "せっし２０００どを　こえる　ほのおを へそから　ふきだす。　ルールむようの らんぼうな　たたかいが　とくい。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Les flammes qui émanent de son nombril dépassent les 2 000 °C. Il n’est jamais aussi à l’aise que lorsque tous les coups sont permis.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It excels at violent, no-holds-barred battles. The temperature of the flames that issue from its navel exceeds 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "摂氏２０００度を　超える　炎を へそから　噴き出す。　ルール無用の 乱暴な　戦いが　得意。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "らんぼうな　ふるまいも　めにつくが ちいさい　ポケモンを　たすける やさしい　いちめんも　もっている。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Bien qu’il soit parfois brutal, il sait aussi se montrer attentionné en venant en aide aux petits Pokémon.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Incineroar’s rough and aggressive behavior is its most notable trait, but the way it helps out small Pokémon shows that it has a kind side as well.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "乱暴な　ふるまいも　目につくが 小さい　ポケモンを　助ける 優しい　一面も　もっている。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      }
